<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Food Price Index rises 0.2 pct in February.</title>
<headline>NZ Food Price Index rises 0.2 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Thursday released the following data for the Food Price Index for February:</p>
<p>    Feb 1997	    Jan 1997		 Feb 1996</p>
<p>    +0.2 pct	    +0.6 pct		 -0.1 pct</p>
<p>yr-end Feb 1997  yr-end Jan 1997  yr-end Feb 1996</p>
<p>    +2.7 pct	    +2.4 pct		 -0.1 pct</p>
<p>Note - The index makes up 18 percent of the consumer price index (CPI).</p>
<p>Food subgroups, percentage change from the same month of the previous year:</p>
<p>				    Feb 1997	Jan 1997</p>
<p>    Fruit and Vegetables    +6.9 pct	-0.4 pct</p>
<p>    Meat, fish and poultry  +1.9 pct	+3.0 pct</p>
<p>    Grocery food etc	  +2.3 pct	+3.2 pct</p>
<p>    Restaurants		 +2.2 pct	+2.0 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
